00:37:28.460 --> 00:37:29.060
How about yourself?

00:37:29.060 --> 00:37:29.630
You off anywhere?

00:37:29.630 --> 00:37:30.380
MELANIE WARRICK:
Nothing to announce

00:37:30.380 --> 00:37:31.850
right now, but probably later.

00:37:31.850 --> 00:37:32.930
MARK MANDEL: Good
stuff coming up.

00:37:32.930 --> 00:37:33.596
All right, cool.

00:37:33.596 --> 00:37:35.270
Well, Melanie, thank
you for joining me

00:37:35.270 --> 00:37:37.676
